{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        140.82620239257812,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "4.1 CHAPTER OBJECTIVES",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        60.276031494140625,
        282.4861145019531,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This chapter deﬁnes the terms used in the recommendations.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53720474243164,
        90.10234069824219,
        109.02019500732422,
        99.10234069824219
      ],
      "text": "4.2 DEFINITIONS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546207427978516,
        108.10234069824219,
        142.68917846679688,
        117.10234069824219
      ],
      "text": "Index case (index patient)",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546207427978516,
        120.27005004882812,
        399.5225830078125,
        129.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "The initially identiﬁed case of new or recurrent TB in a person of any age in a speciﬁc household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.35720443725586,
        132.26705932617188,
        307.6142272949219,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "or other comparable setting in which others may have been exposed",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.366207122802734,
        150.26705932617188,
        71.76020812988281,
        159.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        162.27603149414062,
        399.6838684082031,
        171.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "An index case is the case around which a contact investigation is centered. Because the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        174.27304077148438,
        399.9357604980469,
        183.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "investigation generally focuses on a deﬁned group of potentially exposed people in which",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.7621955871582,
        186.27005004882812,
        400.37713623046875,
        195.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "other (secondary) cases may be found, the index case is generally the case identiﬁed initially,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.77119827270508,
        198.26705932617188,
        400.0985412597656,
        207.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "although she or he may not be the source case. Contact investigation may center on secondary",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.924198150634766,
        210.26406860351562,
        347.6826171875,
        219.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "cases if the exposed group differs from that exposed to the original index case.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5286979675293,
        246.10523986816406,
        72.89469146728516,
        255.10523986816406
      ],
      "text": "Contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5286979675293,
        258.27294921875,
        313.4286193847656,
        267.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "Any person who has been exposed to an index case (as deﬁned above)",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53770065307617,
        276.27294921875,
        71.93170166015625,
        285.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        288.27606201171875,
        399.87359619140625,
        297.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Exposure may be intense or casual, easily identiﬁed or obscure. Close exposure, such as sharing",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.69919967651367,
        300.2730712890625,
        400.5395202636719,
        309.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "a living or working space, is generally easily identiﬁed and quantiﬁed, whereas casual exposure,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.93320083618164,
        312.27008056640625,
        322.6172180175781,
        321.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "such as on public transport or in social situations, may be unidentiﬁable.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.942203521728516,
        348.099365234375,
        116.1841812133789,
        357.099365234375
      ],
      "text": "Household contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.942203521728516,
        360.26708984375,
        402.0150451660156,
        369.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "A person who shared the same enclosed living space for one or more nights or for frequent",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.88820266723633,
        372.26409912109375,
        399.65704345703125,
        381.2731018066406
      ],
      "text": "or extended periods during the day with the index case during the 3 months before",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.492191314697266,
        384.2701110839844,
        235.95753479003906,
        393.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "commencement of the current treatment episode",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.502506256103516,
        402.2730712890625,
        71.89649963378906,
        411.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        414.27606201171875,
        399.738037109375,
        423.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Deﬁnitions of ‘household’ vary considerably and must be adapted to the local context. Within",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5641975402832,
        426.2730712890625,
        399.711181640625,
        435.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "households, there is a gradation of exposure, ranging from sharing the same bed as the index",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53719711303711,
        438.27008056640625,
        399.7470397949219,
        447.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "case to living in the same compound but not in the same enclosed space. Quantiﬁcation of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58219528198242,
        450.2670593261719,
        399.531005859375,
        459.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "the amount of exposure, estimated as the time spent with the index case, is likely to be highly",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.35719680786133,
        462.2640686035156,
        399.70159912109375,
        471.2753601074219
      ],
      "text": "subjective. For this reason, the infectious period for the index case is set somewhat arbitrarily",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.527706146240234,
        474.2723388671875,
        399.67449951171875,
        483.2723388671875
      ],
      "text": "at 3 months before initiation of treatment rather than relying on recall by the index case of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.509708404541016,
        486.2693176269531,
        401.6544494628906,
        495.2693176269531
      ],
      "text": "the time symptoms began. The 3-month period is a general guideline; the actual period",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.527706146240234,
        498.2663269042969,
        399.8994445800781,
        507.2663269042969
      ],
      "text": "of infectiousness may be longer or shorter. For example, prolonged infectiousness may be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.73470687866211,
        510.2633361816406,
        399.69256591796875,
        519.2723388671875
      ],
      "text": "associated with nonadherence (if directly observed treatment is not being used) or with",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51870346069336,
        522.2693481445312,
        221.78433227539062,
        531.2711791992188
      ],
      "text": "unrecognized or untreated MDR-TB or XDR-TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.2281036376953,
        651.97265625,
        224.9831085205078,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "28",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}